{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tech-strategy-frameworks","title":"技术战略框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/foundations/tech-strategy-frameworks","wordCount":1741,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"build-buy-partner-decisions","title":"自建、外购与合作决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/foundations/build-buy-partner-decisions","wordCount":1567,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"technology-lifecycle-management","title":"技术生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/foundations/technology-lifecycle-management","wordCount":1739,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 基础框架\n\n技术战略的基础在于建立三层决策能力：用什么框架分析技术方向、如何在自建与外购之间做出理性选择、怎样管理技术资产从引入到退役的完整生命周期。这三篇文档构成技术战略决策者的底层操作系统——框架提供思考结构，决策模型提供选择标准，生命周期管理提供时间维度的治理节奏。\n\n掌握这些基础后，你将具备进入雷达方法论章节的认知准备：理解为什么需要一套系统化的技术评估工具，以及它如何与这里的决策框架形成互补。\n"}